					"Code": "float3 n=normalize(N);int F=abs(n.z)<.99?0:(n.z>0?1:2);float3 W=pow(abs(n),8);W/=max(dot(W,float3(1,1,1)),.0001);\nstatic const float Strength[3]={0.800000011921,0.300000011921,0.180000007153};\nfloat3 S=float3(n.x>=0?1:-1,n.y>=0?1:-1,n.z>=0?1:-1);\nfloat2 A=X.xy/max(X.z,.1),B=Y.xy/max(Y.z,.1),C=Z.xy/max(Z.z,.1);\nfloat3 D=float3(0,A.x,A.y*S.x)*W.x+float3(B.x,0,-B.y*S.y)*W.y+float3(C.x,C.y*S.z,0)*W.z;\nreturn normalize(n+(D-n*dot(n,D))*Strength[F]);",
					"Description": "Independent DX normal in signed world bases; unperturbed geometry selects family"
				}
			},
